# Line-ending conversion off for the two files where bytes matter:
#   ref/18-flip.html  the baseline the parity harness compares against
#   index.html        generated, and regenerated byte-for-byte by the bundler
# Everything else uses git's normal text handling.
ref/18-flip.html -text
index.html -text

# Batch files want CRLF on checkout, wherever they were committed from.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
